config RYONG_BLE_PROFILES
    bool "Ryong Bluetooth profile manager RPC (Easy-Switch style)"
    depends on ZMK_STUDIO && ZMK_BLE && SETTINGS && !ZMK_SPLIT
    default n
    help
      Secured Studio RPC listing keyboard-side BLE slots with user names,
      switching the selected slot and removing the keyboard-side bond plus
      its stored name and per-profile OS preference. Peer addresses and keys
      are never exposed. Physical behaviour is unverified until tested.
